8.88,"topicId":"institutions","topicLabel":"Institutions"}]},"GENERATOR":{"slug":"generator","body":"The Generator, an early investigation into artificially intelligent architecture, was designed with no specific program, but only a desired end-effect, in mind. The project was commissioned by Howard Gilman for a site at the Gilman Paper Corporation's White Oak Plantation in Florida to provide a facility to house dance, theater, and visiting artists. Cedric Price explored a type of architecture that, like medicine, would operate less as a remedy for the ills of society and more as a preventive system, creating flexible conditions previously thought impossible within a socially beneficial environment.","subtitle":"Faculty of Architecture","image":"/cedric-price-memory-bank/cards/generator.jpg","external":"http://www.moma.org/collection/object.php?object_id=895","location":"https://www.google.com/maps/place/White+Oak,+GA+31568,+USA/@31.0313095,-81.7339961,13z","also":[{"slug":"john-frazer","name":"John Frazer","time":219.32,"topicId":"generator","topicLabel":"GENERATOR"},{"slug":"john-frazer","name":"John Frazer","time":426.44,"topicId":"generator","topicLabel":"GENERATOR"},{"slug":"john-frazer","name":"John Frazer","time":658.12,"topicId":"conscience","topicLabel":"Conscience"},{"slug":"john-frazer","name":"John Frazer","time":786.36,"topicId":"technology","topicLabel":"Technology"},{"slug":"john-frazer","name":"John Frazer","time":1683.8,"topicId":"thinking","topicLabel":"Thinking"},{"slug":"john-frazer","name":"John Frazer","time":1709.08,"topicId":"generator","topicLabel":"GENERATOR"},{"slug":"samantha-hardingham","name":"Samantha Hardingham","time":677.68,"topicId":"fun-palace","topicLabel":"FUN PALACE"},{"slug":"samantha-hardingham","name":"Samantha Hardingham","time":1272.88,"topicId":"enabling","topicLabel":"Enabling"}]}}}